The multi-platform gateway pattern in this package (BridgeProvider
interface, per-platform adapters) is reimplemented in TypeScript
based on Hermes Agent's gateway/platforms/ module.

Substantial reworking includes:
- Migration from Python to TypeScript
- Adaptation to MCP tool surface
- Replacement of Hermes' agent loop with mosadd's m* OS module model
- Integration with @m0ssad/core radar middleware
- BYOK credential model

Original MIT license terms preserved.
